<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eÿngenommen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fehrner</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> notwendige fürsehung gethon, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> wir
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihren</unclear> freündt-, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlichen</unclear> danckh sagen.
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wöllen</unclear> denselben, auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebenmeßiger</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>nachbarlicher und wolmeinender <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vertreüwlich</unclear>-
<lb n="15"/>keit, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unangefüegt</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/>Nach dem wir vor disem, von dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregten</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Madruzischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Aufbruch</unclear>, und daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßelbige</unclear> volckh
<lb n="18"/>den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Paß</unclear> widerumb alhie, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear> auch
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>, nemmen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnomen</unclear> nit ermanglet, alle mitel <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzenemen</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/>ob diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Paßs</unclear>, durch hilff und zuothuen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsrer</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear>- und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Religionsgnoßen</unclear>, möchte gar ver-
<lb n="23"/>hindert werden, wie dann, eben zuo
<lb n="24"/>dem end von der Statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zürich</placeName>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Länderen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Glarus</placeName> und <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ußeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roden</unclear></placeName>
