<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wenigsten</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Grentzen</unclear> abweisen, und also
