<lb n="66"/>verstanden, daß zwar an den Abbt, durch
<lb n="67"/><persName resp="#ner">J: Wolff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jonaßen</unclear></persName>, und dann durch deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obristen</unclear>
<lb n="68"/>von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Madruez</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obristen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Leütenant</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vettern</unclear>,
